# Planning, status and pitch documents. They were the working record of a 36-hour build and they
# contradict each other by design — nine overlapping plans, several superseded. Kept on disk so the
# team can still read them, out of the repo so the public front is the README and the code.
internal/

# Agent-harness mirrors, not project code. These are generated copies of a locally installed skill
# and of CLAUDE.md; nothing in the product reads them and nothing regenerates them here.
.agents/
.codex/
.impeccable/
AGENTS.md
.claude/skills/
.claude/agents/

# Raw per-job provider downloads: duplicated byte-for-byte into each sample's result/ and bundle.zip.
samples/*/.data/

# Local scratch
*.log
.DS_Store

# Scratch copies made while building without VITE_API_BASE.
*.bak
